            "externalReferenceCode": "course-building-enterprise-websites-liferay",
            "title": "Building Enterprise Websites with Liferay",
            "shortDescription": "tudents will master how to layout pages using Liferay Content Pages, widgets, and standard layout containers, focusing on building a user-centric navigation experience",
            "courseProgram": "<p>The curriculum begins with site setup, page planning, and navigation configurations. Students will master how to layout pages using Liferay Content Pages, widgets, and standard layout containers, focusing on building a user-centric navigation experience.</p><p>In the second half, the focus shifts to dynamic content publication. Students will learn to map web content structures and templates, set up asset publishers, and create personalized experiences using Liferay segments and experiences. Finally, we will cover responsive layouts and style books to polish the site design.</p>",
