            "externalReferenceCode": "course-mastering-frontend-client-extensions",
            "title": "Mastering Liferay Frontend Client Extensions",
            "shortDescription": "This program kicks off with a comprehensive deep-dive into standard custom elements",
            "courseProgram": "<p>This program kicks off with a comprehensive deep-dive into standard custom elements. You will configure client-extension.yaml to map, package, and deploy micro-frontends (React/Angular) upgrade-proof onto Liferay pages, mastering decoupled asset loading.</p><p>We then transition to advanced client-side orchestration. You will establish client-side routing, handle cross-element state communication, and leverage Liferay's globally injected theme variables and CSS tokens to ensure that your external extensions automatically blend with the active portal theme.</p>",
