            "externalReferenceCode": "course-mastering-data-modeling-objects",
            "title": "Mastering Data Modeling with Liferay Objects",
            "shortDescription": "The program starts with custom object modeling, fields setup, and publishing flows",
            "courseProgram": "<p>The program starts with custom object modeling, fields setup, and publishing flows. Students will learn the database layout, mapping rules, and how Liferay automatically structures headless REST APIs for every custom object published in the system.</p><p>Next, we master triggers and validation logic. You will write robust validation scripts, set up object triggers to perform actions on database states, configure Many-to-Many and One-to-Many relationships between objects, and orchestrate external integrations using real-time outgoing webhooks.</p>",
            "duration": "5 weeks",
            "lessons": 11,
            "quizzes": 3,
